-- Riverglades (zone 16591, map 0): live's creatures where live has them, from a live capture made on 26-27 November 2026 (client
-- 1.60.1.71139): the player flew in by taxi from Undercity at 00:06:38 and walked around the Riverglades flight point for about 9
-- minutes. 272 creatures were seen (positions are where each was first seen; spawns live made in front of the player are left out).
-- What changes:
--  * the 272 live spawns are added with zoneId 16591 and live's areaId where the capture gives it (0 where not); respawn 5
--    minutes, MovementType 0 (live's paths not taken: what the capture shows of them is too short to be a path).
--  * 62 of our 123 spawns in the zone are removed: 28 because live has the same kind within 20 yards (live's spot
--    replaces ours), 34 because they stood where the capture could see (within 60 yards of the player's walk or 40 yards of a live
--    creature) and live has none of that kind there. Removed: Chogg'Zac x1; Clubtoe x1; Da'grosh x1; Empowered Brute x4; Freshwater Crocolisk x1; Fuzzle x1; Gorg x1; Grakna x1; Grik x1; Gur'dok x1; High Plains Buzzard x1; Innkeeper Toka x1; Krek the Noxious x2; Kreza Darkthorn x1; Krom'rosh x1; Maka x1; Naluk x1; Neza Bloodsnout x1; Rog'mar Grunt x3; Rog'mar Poacher x2; Rog'mar Trainee x2; Tan'jani x1; Tran'gul x1; Twilight Brute x1; Twilight Corrupter x1; Twilight Fanatic x2; Twilight Neophyte x4; Twilight Raider x1; Twilight Ritualist x5; Twilight Shadowmancer x6; Twilight Subjugator x1; Wildplains Huntress x5; Wildplains Patriarch x2; Young Paletusk x3.
--  * the other 61 stay as they are: out of view of the capture (it does not prove they are wrong), or pooled, rare, or an NPC
--    with a service (Spirit Healer, Farmer Elbrim, Sergeant Riftan, Apprentice Claire, Blademaster Kaijo's pool).
--  * Twilight Worg 257017, which our world lacked: from the capture: name, beast (type 1, family wolf), faction 14, warrior class,
--    model 246, movement 1693, levels 37-38, health as live (HealthModifier 1.0 = 1814 / 1814 at level 38). INFERRED: speeds,
--    attack times, damage (template defaults); no loot and not skinnable (live's loot is not in the capture).
-- Creature guids 48151000-48151271. Safe to run again.
